浅蓝海面与轻微虚化的小渔船。柔和阳光从画面左后方照来，勾亮发丝与衣服边缘；浅色地面与天空的反射光均匀照亮面部，眼睛中有细小清亮的反光，鼻翼和眼下没有浓重阴影。\n\n奶油白、淡海蓝与浅沙色构成轻盈的配色，低反差、柔和高光、自然偏暖的肤色。保留真实而细腻的皮肤纹理、棉麻衣料与轻微胶片颗粒。两人专注于彼此，表演松弛，呈现漂亮年轻恋人之间真切的心动。横向完整电影画面，无文字、字幕、水印和黑边。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Text (User Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [997.108154296875, 387.2851257324219], "pos": [390, 0], "id": 25, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.41.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [84], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 62, "label": "samples", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "samples"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 63, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "VAEDecode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [290, 80], "pos": [1348.347900390625, 860], "id": 37, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.41.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecode"}, "order": 21}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "links": [], "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["moss_image_t2i"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 84, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SaveImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [560, 740], "pos": [2398.146728515625, 0], "id": 45, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.41.0", "w